1
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,120
So Xiaoxiao is the obstacle

2
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:45,040
to He Huan to get what she wants,

3
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,840
which is Zhengyan Group.

4
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,160
Zizhou.

5
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,360
Over the past eighteen years,

6
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,480
the He siblings acted with impunity in Stellarport

7
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:03,680
because

8
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,640
they had a mysterious backer

9
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:06,600
from Guangcheng,

10
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:07,880
with immense wealth

11
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:08,960
and overwhelming power.

12
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:09,880
But recently,

13
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,400
a national investigator

14
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:14,560
from Helie is tailing him.

15
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,040
National investigator?

16
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:19,200
When I was on a mission in Wulai Island,

17
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,320
I met one

18
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,640
named Bai Feng.

19
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:22,560
Bai Feng?

20
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:28,760
I wonder

21
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,760
if he's this one.

22
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:33,440
It's him.

23
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,760
On Wulai Island,

24
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,280
how was your relationship?

25
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,160
We once fought alongside.

26
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:41,760
But we can't reveal ourselves to him yet.

27
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,560
Because he's Helie's

28
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,360
representative to ISA.

29
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:46,880
Now,

30
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:49,560
he's the Night Watch of national security,

31
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:53,040
In this wasteland of order controlled by tycoons,

32
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,480
he's the one who's most likely

33
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,600
to be silenced by He Huan and her people.

34
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:58,840
Zizhou.

35
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,240
Then we should...

36
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,560
Provide evidence

37
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:02,760
and tactical support covertly.

38
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:03,960
If necessary,

39
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,040
step in to save him.

40
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:07,200
Xie Zhengyan has been missing for years.

41
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,080
They claim

42
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:10,360
he's been overseeing a major project in Gangna.

43
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,560
But I suspect

44
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,880
he's being held captive by He Huan.

45
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,600
Your priority is to find him.

46
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:18,560
Held captive?

47
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,840
He might be at...

48
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,760
I've obtained the footage

49
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,480
Zong Xiaoquan took at Doll Bar

50
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:35,000
and made Lu Yuanyuan confess.

51
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,920
She's terrified now.

52
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,520
Should we arrest Lu Yuanyuan directly

53
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,000
or let her go for now?

54
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,000
Let her go.

55
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,800
Make her a tainted witness.

56
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,520
Lu Yuanyuan can't go to the police station.

57
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:51,160
Some high up would inform He Huan.

58
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,440
For this incident,

59
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,880
make her plan her story.

60
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,400
If her act isn't convincing,

61
00:03:58,720 --> 00:04:01,720
