62
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,400
she'll be silenced.

63
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,800
Let's stay put for now.

64
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,480
Give it time

65
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:09,320
to catch the big fish.

66
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,440
Okay

67
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,200
Is Bai Feng okay?

68
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,400
Don't mention it.

69
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:18,640
This time, Bai Feng

70
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,040
was drugged with stimulants

71
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,840
and nearly slept with Lu Yuanyuan.

72
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:27,080
Lu Gao sent killers bursting in.

73
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,880
When Bai Feng fought back,

74
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,840
he found himself completely weakened.

75
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,040
He couldn't dodge

76
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,160
and got stabbed.

77
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,280
Luckily,

78
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,240
Yu Jinning reached Bai Feng's place

79
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,560
and bandaged him up.

80
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,120
He's fine for now.

81
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,680
This time,

82
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,440
he escaped death.

83
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,280
He just woke up

84
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,320
and asked to see you.

85
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,520
I should go see him.

86
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,640
For the Causeway Cape Strait incident,

87
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,480
I need him

88
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,440
to help us hand over the case

89
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,240
to the Helie highest judicial authority

90
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:05,080
for judgement.

91
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,080
On Wulai Island,

92
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,680
we both survived.

93
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:24,480
Never thought in Stellarport,

94
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,600
I'd see you wounded.

95
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,360
Long time no see,

96
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,840
and you're still talking so mean.

97
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,680
You knew that wretch Lu Yuanyuan

98
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,320
was coming to ruin me,

99
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,840
yet you didn't rush to save me?

100
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:41,800
Look at this wound.

101
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,200
We almost never saw each other again.

102
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,480
You're the all-powerful

103
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:52,000
HLJ National Investigator,

104
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:54,360
the Night Watch

105
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,080
who safeguards national security.

106
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:01,080
Take the video of Lu Yuanyuan and He Zhengnian,

107
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,880
convince her

108
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,920
to become a tainted witness.

109
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,600
Then your blood

110
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,920
won't be shed in vain.

111
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,160
Night Watch?

112
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,400
It sounds great.

113
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,320
But

114
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:20,120
in this wasteland of order,

115
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:23,680
I'm most likely to be silenced by gray forces controlled by the tycoons.

116
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,240
The Causeway Cape Strait ahead

117
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:35,000
is the world's most tempting capital cake.

118
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,400
Here,

119
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:38,880
various forces are deeply intertwined.

120
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,640
It's a neon abyss.

121
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,960
But even if it's dangerous,

122
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,760
we once vowed

123
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,080
to venture in together.

124
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,120
We can't let criminals

125
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,800
get away from punishment.

126
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,600
Thanks, Chief.

127
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,400
We chose this job,

128
00:07:03,880 --> 00:07:05,640
full of danger and challenges.

129
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:07,440
Yet we still

130
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,560
use our bodies

131
00:07:09,080 --> 00:07:11,440
to build a safety barrier for the people.

132
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,800
Only by

133
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,880
illuminating this abyss,

134
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,160
can we live up to

135
00:07:18,560 --> 00:07:19,880
these uniforms we wear.

136
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:38,680
Justice may be delayed,

137
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:39,800
but

138
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:42,160
it will never be absent.

139
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:45,920
Because countless people like us

140
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,280
persist.

141
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,720
Every time you speak,

142
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:52,440
it stirs my soul.

143
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,880
But charging against the wind,

144
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,480
we must

145
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,320
protect ourselves first.

146
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:03,080
No one was born to be a hero.

147
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,840
When duty calls,

148
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:07,320
the hardest part

149
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:10,400
is to hold fast to the bottom line of the law

150
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,640
and stand guard

151
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,000
in silence.

152
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,080
Officer Chen issued a notice,

153
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,560
making Doll Bar think Amina is dead.

154
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:22,600
Yu Jinning revived her.

155
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,720
Amina agreed to testify.

156
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,800
The day Xiaoxiao was assaulted,

157
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,640
she was also there.

158
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:31,320
She overheard plans to explode Bayron Commercial Street

159
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,600
while going to

160
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:35,080
the restroom.

161
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,480
The whole story of the Strait incident

162
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,080
is becoming clearer.

163
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,720
Now,

164
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:47,640
we need to find the shadow figure behind Zhengyan Group

165
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,760
to advance the mission.

166
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,840
Shadow figure?

167
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:54,560
He's just a mercenary leader from Wulai Island,

168
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,600
Kang Qingtian.

169
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,680
Helie's Justice Department

170
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:57,760
has long wanted to take him down.

171
00:08:58,560 --> 00:08:59,880
Why still hold back?

172
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,600
We plan to use him

173
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,640
to topple the international drug lord,

174
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:04,720
Victor.

175
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,920
We can win

176
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,240
by wearing down the enemy

177
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,840
rather than attacking them directly.

178
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,160
I'll use Lu Yuanyuan

179
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,640
to get close to Liluo

180
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,040
and infiltrate Zhengyan Group

181
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:18,880
to find a breakthrough.

182
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,320
Owning this brand's necklace

183
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:22,920
means he belongs to

184
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,560
one of the world's major families.

185
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:26,760
Is it...?

186
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:28,880
Lu Yuanyuan,

187
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:32,160
can't believe there's someone in Stellarport I don't know?

188
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,640
He's quite refined.

189
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:35,920
Who is he

190
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,440
to catch your eye?

191
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:41,040
You're about to enter the National Film Academy

192
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,560
and become a star.

193
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,720
Who could possibly impress you?

194
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,200
I've been restless lately.

195
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,640
Need something new.

196
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,200
Go get his business card.

197
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,680
What?

198
00:10:50,800 --> 00:10:52,080
Seriously?

199
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,560
Our Liluo finally takes a liking to someone?

200
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,240
Just go.

201
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,800
Enough chatter.

202
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,640
Got it.

203
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,800
Watch me work my charm.

204
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:16,800
What can I do for you?

205
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:20,120
May I

206
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:22,640
have your business card?

207
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:23,520
Sorry,

208
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:26,720
I'm not sharing my card at the moment.

209
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,200
Let's maintain some mystery,

210
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:30,160
shall we?

211
00:11:34,440 --> 00:11:35,400
I just

212
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:37,120
want a business card.

213
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,160
Sorry.

214
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:47,920
Well-designed.

215
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:50,800
I want to invite you to join us.

216
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:52,600
Zhengyan Group.

217
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,920
Thanks.

218
00:11:55,840 --> 00:11:57,240
But I'm doing this

219
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:58,360
for a competition,

220
00:11:58,920 --> 00:12:00,080
not for a job.

221
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,560
You mean,

222
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:06,000
International Sailboat Hotel Design Competition?

223
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,400
It's held by us.

224
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,400
Really?

225
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,240
What a coincidence!

226
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,760
Such an honor.

227
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:15,480
Aries.

228
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,160
Lauren.

229
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,560
Sorry, wait a minute.

230
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:23,080
Hello?

231
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:27,400
Hi, Aries! Prosperity Snow Bank has approved your design.

232
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:30,120
That’s a great news

233
00:12:31,160 --> 00:12:34,400
And you're required to return  at your earliest convenience.

234
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:35,800
Okay,

235
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:37,360
I get it.

236
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,360
I'll be back

237
00:12:38,680 --> 00:12:39,480
when I

238
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:41,560
finish this competition.

239
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:43,960
Bye.

240
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,360
Congratulations!

241
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,920
Thanks for your invitation.

242
00:12:49,680 --> 00:12:51,520
I'll see you next time.

243
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,640
It's a deal.

244
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:56,960
These two

245
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,280
hit it off right away.

246
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:02,000
Bye,

247
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,560
handsome.

248
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:05,880
Alright,

249
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,040
he's gone.

250
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:08,840
If you can't speak properly, don't embarrass me.

251
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:11,560
Yes, my princess.

252
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:52,200
Liluo.

253
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,280
Mom.

254
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:01,320
Here's your admission letter.

255
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:04,080
In a few months, you'll be off to Guangcheng.

256
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:06,280
Your future path will be brilliant.

257
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,840
Do you like it?

258
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,040
I really like it.

259
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:29,640
Mom,

260
00:14:30,760 --> 00:14:32,440
but for now,

261
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:35,360
I don't want to go to the Helie National Film Academy.

262
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:39,360
What?

263
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:42,800
Haven't you wanted to be a star since you were little?

264
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:45,080
Uncle Kang has already arranged everything for you there.

265
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:46,080
Why are you changing your mind now?

266
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,000
Mom,

267
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,640
after what happened to Yan Xiaoxiao,

268
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:51,400
my classmates are all afraid of me.

269
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:54,480
It's made me lose all motivation to prepare for the exams.

270
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,000
And,

271
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,440
today I met someone.

272
00:15:12,320 --> 00:15:13,360
Who is it?

273
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:18,120
A designer who returned from overseas.

274
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,280
His name is Aries.

275
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,840
He's drawing designs,

276
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:23,800
preparing for the design competition held by Zhengyan Group.

277
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:28,520
Designer Aries?
